，秦武王與孟説舉龍文赤鼎，絶臏而死。趙王使代相趙固迎公子稷於燕，送歸，立爲秦王，是爲昭王。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:p075","quote":"主父欲令子主治國，而身胡服將士大夫西北略胡地，而欲從雲中、九原直南襲秦，於是詐自爲使者入秦。秦昭王不知，已而怪其狀甚偉，非人臣之度，使人逐之，而主父馳已脱關矣。審問之，乃主父也。秦人大驚。主父所以入秦者，欲自略地形，因觀秦王之爲人也。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:p092","quote":"二十年，廉頗將，攻齊。王與秦昭王遇西河外。"}],"rationale":"限本篇明示姓名、是為與連續事件；太戊午／大戊午暫接但字形待底本核查。娃嬴／孟姚／惠后按本段明示暫接，不與先前夢辭孟姚按同名合併；王紲與較早公子紲分候選。君王職稱按各國上下文辨別，不全域匹配。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:p066","text":"十八年，秦武王與孟説舉龍文赤鼎，絶臏而死。趙王使代相趙固迎公子稷於燕，送歸，立爲秦王，是爲昭王。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m066-0004","start":4,"end":7,"surface":"秦武王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002398","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m066-0008","start":8,"end":10,"surface":"孟説","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002399","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m066-0021","start":21,"end":23,"surface":"趙王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002380","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m066-0024","start":24,"end":26,"surface":"代相","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、夢中女子或待核官稱／親稱保留；不從同名、國號與未名先王補個人。"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m066-0026","start":26,"end":28,"surface":"趙固","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002400","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m066-0029","start":29,"end":32,"surface":"公子稷","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002401","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m066-0040","start":40,"end":42,"surface":"秦王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002401","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m066-0045","start":45,"end":47,"surface":"昭王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002401","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao","book_id":"b-shiji-043","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-043-zhao"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:p075","text":"主父欲令子主治國，而身胡服將士大夫西北略胡地，而欲從雲中、九原直南襲秦，於是詐自爲使者入秦。秦昭王不知，已而怪其狀甚偉，非人臣之度，使人逐之，而主父馳已脱關矣。審問之，乃主父也。秦人大驚。主父所以入秦者，欲自略地形，因觀秦王之爲人也。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m075-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"主父","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002380","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m075-0046","start":46,"end":49,"surface":"秦昭王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002401","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m075-0072","start":72,"end":74,"surface":"主父","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002380","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m075-0085","start":85,"end":87,"surface":"主父","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002380","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m075-0094","start":94,"end":96,"surface":"主父","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002380","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m075-0110","start":110,"end":112,"surface":"秦王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002401","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao","book_id":"b-shiji-043","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-043-zhao"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:p092","text":"二十年，廉頗將，攻齊。王與秦昭王遇西河外。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m092-0004","start":4,"end":6,"surface":"廉頗","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002439","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m092-0011","start":11,"end":12,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002424","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m092-0013","start":13,"end":16,"surface":"秦昭王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002401","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao","book_id":"b-shiji-043","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-043-zhao"}],"sources":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-043","source_id